        "prompt": "define",
        "text": "=You are a cybersecurity assistant that analyzes emails for safety.  \n\nHere is the email content:\n---\n{{ $json.email_body }}\n---\n\nCan compare from external source by making http request.\n\nInstructions:\n1. Compare the email content with the scan results.  \n2. Decide if the email is SAFE or SUSPICIOUS.  \n3. If SAFE → explain briefly why.  \n4. If SUSPICIOUS → explain why, and highlight risky indicators (e.g., phishing language, malicious links, impersonation).  \n5. Output your judgement in this exact structured format:\n\n{\n  \"Email_Content\": {\n    \"Verdict\": \"SAFE or SUSPICIOUS\",\n    \"Reason\": \"short explanation\"\n  },\n\n  \"Final_Judgement\": \"SAFE or SUSPICIOUS\",\n  \"Summary\": \"overall conclusion in 1–2 sentences\"\n}\n",
        "options": {}
